- [Jaehong's wife] Oh, are you having a hard time?

229
00:12:37.444 --> 00:12:38.278
[Jonghyun] Huh?

230
00:12:38.361 --> 00:12:40.405
Ah, thank you

231
00:12:49.039 --> 00:12:50.415
Ah...

232
00:12:50.499 --> 00:12:51.750
- That's really cool.
- [Jaehong’s wife’s laughter]

233
