I got caught for no reason
If you get disciplined, it's a pain in the ass.

236
00:13:01.676 --> 00:13:02.552
Have you seen it?

237
00:13:02.636 --> 00:13:03.553
[Mansik] Of course, right?

238
00:13:03.637 --> 00:13:06.056
It's as big as a mountain
Can't you see that, huh?

239
00:13:09.226 --> 00:13:10.602
I'm sorry we can't be together

240
00:13:10.685 --> 00:13:13.772
What am I sorry for?
I know everything clearly

241
