Don't say that, tsk

242
00:13:15.524 --> 00:13:18.777
I put it on now for no reason
It can get harder

243
00:13:18.860 --> 00:13:21.905
If something goes wrong
It won't end with disciplinary action anymore.

244
00:13:21.988 --> 00:13:23.907
Uh, anyway, huh?

245
00:13:23.990 --> 00:13:26.159
These two here are not interested in promotions.

246
00:13:26.243 --> 00:13:28.495
It's okay because he has a lot of money.

247
